              <l xml:id="m-006c72e6-687d-4163-9b50-da97a3726b4c" facs="#m-96dc7682-626d-42f1-b98f-eb046913d5ef" label="ambiguous">December 2. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-e20fec1a-d42a-4bc0-be0e-e229c7552f50" facs="#m-d84d69d7-5a33-4d79-a325-6b60fe491852" label="ambiguous">1300</l><l xml:id="m-187cb0d1-1467-434d-9fbf-09b4d3a985bd" facs="#m-e345bac1-b2f4-4969-b827-a2b751eb9260" label="lyrics-like">lócum ubi crux pa-rá-ta é- rat, exclamávit et dí-xit:</l><l xml:id="m-7a2cddf7-661b-443c-8dbf-9545601392e1" facs="#m-94452bd9-3a6d-4370-a07f-ac89a79ae6fd" label="lyrics-like">Obó-na crux, di-u de-si-de rá-ta, et jam concupiscén¬</l><l xml:id="m-1660e2da-c540-4643-91c6-428658470c64" facs="#m-f0f1eb58-d074-46e2-8fab-5753db197229" label="lyrics-like">ti ánimo praepa-rá-ta: se-cú-rus et gáudens véni¬</l><l xml:id="m-1584d937-7159-4d54-a6b2-52ab6fdc4b9c" facs="#m-c05ca6bb-c6f4-4857-a858-2c617feb089f" label="lyrics-like">te: i-ta et tu exsúltans suscí¬ pi-as me, discípulum</l><l xml:id="m-fc96f287-4c8f-4e1e-8604-5f97126ea2cb" facs="#m-a9055836-b9ec-428a-bff0-77e91e040f64" label="lyrics-like">é- jus qui pepén-dit in te. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-057887fa-a65f-4a3e-8393-c2721bfa02dc" facs="#m-f8a64876-f447-4506-a949-15b46f8dd163" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 1. D. p. 207, or p. 213. — Prayer. Majestátem tuam.</l><l xml:id="m-1a4f5974-0c4d-4d4a-8163-6cdd9fb55dd4" facs="#m-5735206c-d7af-44be-849a-b85b1a854791" label="ambiguous">. 1305.</l><l xml:id="m-5e89c95d-8417-471d-9dd2-5515a813ec45" facs="#m-799b70d6-1b3e-482d-9020-8547029d079b" label="text-like">FEASTS OF DECEMBER.</l><l xml:id="m-3151ed4e-273d-4857-82be-5a1c8bd3205e" facs="#m-6d0f3ab1-b0cb-44be-8435-a67417243f31" label="text-like">St. Bibiana. Virgin and Martyr. Smiouble.</l><l xml:id="m-5cc12692-4187-4ecf-aa49-5df2fa4bcb70" facs="#m-be72e3fa-562d-4629-8166-c87ec2a7c33a" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-7bb6c902-1861-4775-8c24-096c51be5aae" facs="#m-8f877e7a-6f91-41c9-beb7-9ca9d362adaf" label="ambiguou